{"data": [{"id": "2122126112897593360", "author_id": "1104851004397371392", "text": "@testingcatalog I'd actually try Apple glasses if Siri gets way better first. That's the part I need to see!", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:34:27.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Itzkennybe/status/2122126112897593360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122113945284821061", "author_id": "564497304", "text": "@testingcatalog I mean, did they finally wake up? Even Meta is doing better than them.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:46:06.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/himanshu_v92/status/2122113945284821061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122113245398147309", "author_id": "28949586", "text": "@testingcatalog But it’s so terrible. Give me at least Dot level capabilities, and we’re talking. At the moment, it’s barely better than ChatGPT 3.5 level. And the Google speaker with Gemini isn’t much better.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:43:19.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Odds75/status/2122113245398147309", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122090506763280564", "author_id": "1864897473954877440", "text": "@testingcatalog smart glasses with siri ai would be wild", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:12:58.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TekonBurns/status/2122090506763280564", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122074524971684316", "author_id": "2114715046429274112", "text": "@testingcatalog Apple's real advantage could be making AI feel invisible. If Siri can handle useful tasks naturally through glasses, that might matter more than adding another chatbot to the market.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T21:09:27.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/AI_roni_X/status/2122074524971684316", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122047404321165328", "author_id": "1978409518943096832", "text": "@testingcatalog For the booking examples, the interesting interface is the moment before commitment. Read back the place, time and price, then offer a short correction path. Glasses could make requests effortless, but recovering from “Tuesday, not today” needs just as much design attention.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:21:41.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/YXxquf/status/2122047404321165328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122044576600818031", "author_id": "402912676", "text": "@testingcatalog Siri on glasses only works if it gets it right the first time.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:10:27.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/jimaggie/status/2122044576600818031", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122040786451882357", "author_id": "1986169489772453893", "text": "@testingcatalog Took em long enough", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:55:23.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/porygonian/status/2122040786451882357", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122039586775822739", "author_id": "1496823127707459586", "text": "@testingcatalog Siri as the flagship feature is the reason I'd wait", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:50:37.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/MiclauMarius/status/2122039586775822739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122039399949218158", "author_id": "35796579", "text": "@testingcatalog Unless Siri improves tremendously, Meta + Muse is going to dominate the glasses space, IMO.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:49:53.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Ceelow/status/2122039399949218158", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122039077939904605", "author_id": "100247176", "text": "@testingcatalog Logique : des lunettes connectées ne valent presque que par leur assistant vocal. Si Siri AI n'est pas au niveau, Apple n'aura pas grand-chose à opposer aux Ray-Ban Meta, qui ont pris de l'avance.", "lang": "fr", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:48:36.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/xdfdp75/status/2122039077939904605", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122038620165112295", "author_id": "2116339142175199232", "text": "@testingcatalog Glasses are where a voice assistant stops being optional: no keyboard, tiny or no screen, so Siri has to nail multi-step requests on the first try. Latency and on-device privacy will matter more than the frames.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:46:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/betolateral/status/2122038620165112295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122036165133881851", "author_id": "1638868192159227904", "text": "@testingcatalog siri still cant set two timers right and now it gets a spot on my face", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:37:01.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/yevloop/status/2122036165133881851", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122030347995304271", "author_id": "1301751781056151553", "text": "@testingcatalog Siri as the centerpiece is a bold choice. is the bet on the glasses or on Siri finally working?", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:13:55.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/lefeiren129/status/2122030347995304271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122027456160809428", "author_id": "2909689998", "text": "@testingcatalog Calling Siri AI integrations the centrepiece rather than one feature among many makes the glasses the real test of that more serious priority. The not soon part is the telling one.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:02:25.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Sachi_0298/status/2122027456160809428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1104851004397371392", "username": "Itzkennybe", "name": "Itzkennybe", "verified": false}, {"id": "3980735590", "username": "testingcatalog", "name": "🚨 AI News | TestingCatalog", "verified": true}, {"id": "564497304", "username": "himanshu_v92", "name": "Himanshu V", "verified": false}, {"id": "28949586", "username": "Odds75", "name": "Steve PhD", "verified": false}, {"id": "1864897473954877440", "username": "TekonBurns", "name": "Tekon Burns", "verified": false}, {"id": "2114715046429274112", "username": "AI_roni_X", "name": "AIroniX", "verified": false}, {"id": "1978409518943096832", "username": "YXxquf", "name": "波若波罗蜜", "verified": false}, {"id": "402912676", "username": "jimaggie", "name": "Jim Aggie", "verified": false}, {"id": "1986169489772453893", "username": "porygonian", "name": "porygon", "verified": false}, {"id": "1496823127707459586", "username": "MiclauMarius", "name": "Marius Miclau", "verified": false}, {"id": "35796579", "username": "Ceelow", "name": "Ceelow", "verified": false}, {"id": "100247176", "username": "xdfdp75", "name": "piroa", "verified": false}, {"id": "2116339142175199232", "username": "betolateral", "name": "betolateral", "verified": false}, {"id": "1638868192159227904", "username": "yevloop", "name": "E_genius", "verified": false}, {"id": "1301751781056151553", "username": "lefeiren129", "name": "小楽子", "verified": false}, {"id": "2909689998", "username": "Sachi_0298", "name": "Sachin Sharma", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2122126112897593360", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzow691uv4wtuwi3dfbd1dhhyapvh", "oldest_id": "2122027456160809428", "result_count": 15}}